OL,3,GNEWSA250 police in organised crime
OL,4,Acrackdown raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 250 police officers took part
OL,7,Fin raids aimed at disrupting suspected
OL,8,Forganised crime groups in Greater
OL,9,FManchester.
OL,11,FOperation Rivercrest targeted homes in
OL,12,Fand around Heywood, Rochdale.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday, 16 men aged between 19
OL,15,Fand 49, and a 21-year-old woman were
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of offences
OL,17,Fincluding drugs supply, assault,
OL,18,Fviolent disorder, affray, burglary, and
OL,19,Frobbery, GMP said.
